# Optional local overrides for `wrangler dev`.
#
# This file is documentation only: the worker runs with no secrets and no
# mandatory variables. If you need an override, copy this file to `.dev.vars`
# and uncomment the relevant line (never commit `.dev.vars`).
#
# API_KEYS=<comma-separated keys; when set, /api/v1 requires Bearer or x-api-key>
# UPSTREAM_TOKEN=<token forwarded only to UPSTREAM_TOKEN_HOST>
# UPSTREAM_TOKEN_HOST=<hostname that owns UPSTREAM_TOKEN>
# IP_HASH_SECRET=<random string of at least 16 characters>
